{"total_count":4,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/issues/25449","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/issues/25449/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/issues/25449/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/issues/25449/events","html_url":"https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/25449","id":860305910,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NjE3MjM1NDIz","number":25449,"title":"bpo-41559: Change PEP 612 implementation to pure Python","user":{"login":"Fidget-Spinner","id":28750310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzUwMzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28750310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner","html_url":"https://github.com/Fidget-Spinner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2021-04-17T02:46:15Z","updated_at":"2021-05-01T15:25:32Z","closed_at":"2021-04-28T15:38:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/pulls/25449","html_url":"https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/25449","diff_url":"https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/25449.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/25449.patch","merged_at":"2021-04-28T15:38:15Z"},"body":"- Reverted changes in ``genericaliasobject.c`` to commit 463c7d3d149283814d879a9bb8411af64e656c8e (right before PEP 612) via a clean ``git checkout 463c7d3d149283814d879a9bb8411af64e656c8e -- genericaliasobject.c``.\r\n- Implemented PEP 612 behavior only in ``collections.abc.Callable`` in pure Python.\r\n\r\nPR 1/2, another update to typing.py is coming later, but that's not urgent.\r\n\r\nThe intention of this change is to conform more strictly to PEP 612. Specifically, this snippet:\r\n> As before, parameters_expressions by themselves are not acceptable in places where a type is expected\r\n\r\nhttps://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0612/#valid-use-locations\r\n\r\nThe current implementation leaks extra behavior into all builtin ``GenericAlias`` types just for the sake of ``collections.abc.Callable``, which is out of the scope of the PEP. Since there is no need to support ``ParamSpec`` in other places, it's valid to not have them in ``__parameters__`` of all builtin generics. except for ``collections.abc.Callable``.\r\n\r\nThis will also speed up builtin ``GenericAlias`` as it has to do less checks, and reduce the amount of confusing code in ``GenericAlias`` (though it defers that to ``collections.abc.Callable``.)\r\n\r\n<!-- issue-number: [bpo-41559](https://bugs.python.org/issue41559) -->\r\nhttps://bugs.python.org/issue41559\r\n<!-- /issue-number -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/issues/25449/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/issues/25449/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/issues/24000","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/issues/24000/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/issues/24000/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/issues/24000/events","html_url":"https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/24000","id":776009680,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NTQ2NTc0MDgy","number":24000,"title":"bpo-41559: Documentation for PEP 612","user":{"login":"Fidget-Spinner","id":28750310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzUwMzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28750310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner","html_url":"https://github.com/Fidget-Spinner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fidget-Spinner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":667924166,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2Njc5MjQxNjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/labels/skip%20news","name":"skip news","color":"000000","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2020-12-29T17:34:31Z","updated_at":"2021-01-02T09:09:21Z","closed_at":"2021-01-02T00:45:51Z","assignee":null,"author